            %a{:href => "Oka+manifold#ForstnericLarusson11"} Forstnerič &amp; Lárusson 11, p. 9
          = succeed ")" do
            %a{:href => "Oka+manifold#Forstneric13"} Forstnerič 2013, Ex. 2.7
          %h2#examples Examples
          .num_example
            %h6#example Example
            %p
              The
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Grassmannian"} Grassmannian
